claudemd: {
  shape: sequence_diagram

  Core: sdd-core scaffolding
  TP: tech-pack.yaml
  FS: User Project CLAUDE.md

  Core -> Core: generate core sections
  Core."- SDD workflow instructions\n- Spec conventions\n- Directory structure\n- Core CLI commands"

  Core -> TP: read tech-pack.yaml
  TP -> Core: component_types, cli_actions

  Core -> Core: generate tech pack sections
  Core."- Available component types + descriptions\n- Available agents + roles\n- Tech pack CLI commands\n- Standards skills to reference"

  Core -> FS: write CLAUDE.md (combined core + tech pack instructions)
}
